      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t agree that drivers need to support OS-INHERIT this way.\nThey shouldn\u0027t know about project parents, etc. They should *only* know what are the *entities* they need to CRUD and their *attributes*.\n\nIn this case, the driver needs to know that if parent_projects are provided, we have to query for inherited role assignments in this context. For me, this is part of business logic, and bussiness logic have to be on the Manager.\n\nI know this is unrelated to this patch, but I need to check if you agree with me on this point. If so, we need to report a bug.",
